; The Seeder's mine (ADR 0037 section 8, GDD): the blast radius is the GDD's (1.5 tiles). The damage
; ("less" than the shot charge's) and the percents ("better against squads") are starting values for
; the balance run. Range and cooldown are unused: a mine is not fired.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_weapon")
id = &"pulse_seed"
damage = 100
vs_armour = PackedInt32Array(150, 80, 50, 100)
blast_milli = 1500
